ind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0","summary":"The Ever After Again demo has been updated This patch cleans up combat — no more swings passing through enemies on stairs, after the grappling hook, or in Berserker — restores the missing Japanese, Chinese and Korean characters in the book, rebalances the Book of Destinies mix so the narrator sits above the music, and adds inverted Y-axis. Patch notes Fixed bugs with voice lines Fixed a facial animation bug for Zenobia Fixed a bug where the Cutlass can pass through enemies and miss when fighting","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T19:12:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505217","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4185200-1843481262689571","game_id":"steam-4185200","kind":"announcement","title":"The People of Boreas","summary":"In case you haven't played it (yet), Stories: The Path of Destinies is a tongue-in-cheek self-aware epic hero’s journey, with Reynardo the sly fox, an evil emperor named Isengrim, his daughter the fabulous princess Zenobia, and a tricksy rabbit Lapino.For Ever After Again: A Stories Adventure, we wanted to take the storytelling a little farther. We’re ten years later (just like in real life!) and Reynardo hasn’t been hero-ing much lately; he’s settled down with the lovely Zenobia, keeping busy p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T16:11:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689571","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4185200-1841579228663454","game_id":"steam-4185200","kind":"announcement","title":"Reynardo’s back - and so are we!","summary":"Hi everyone, it’s Atul from Spearhead Games hereW